      "content": "hey, i'm starting a new blog series about modern morality and stuff. i want to write a post about what people actually need to be \"good\" citizens today, especially with how diverse and digital everything is now. can u help me out? like, what would u say are the most important virtues for a citizen in a multicultural, digital-age democracy?",
