      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "A healthy democracy requires a dynamic balance between both social justice and individual liberty, as neither framework alone provides true stability. An overemphasis on unrestrained individualism can lead to disregard for the collective good, while excessive focus on equity without personal freedom risks stifling necessary change. Therefore, the most functional society prioritizes a robust sense of mutual responsibility, ensuring that liberties are exercised in a way that promotes overall collective well-being.",
